*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "G2010NAT.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Canon"
*Product: "(Canon G2010 series - native)"
*ModelName: "Canon G2010 series native"
*ShortNickName: "G2010 native"
*NickName: "Canon G2010 series native (inline BJRaster3)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Canon;MDL:G2010 series;CMD:BJRaster3;"

*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsManualCopies: True

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.276 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Page Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.276 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*OpenUI *Resolution/Output Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% Native pipeline: any printable input is converted straight to the raw
*% inline-BJRaster3 carriage by our filter, then copied verbatim to the backend
*% (socket://127.0.0.1:9100 -> canon-g2010-sink -> /dev/usb/lp0).
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/vnd.cups-raw 0 canon-g2010"
*cupsFilter2: "application/postscript application/vnd.cups-raw 0 canon-g2010"

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "18 36 577 806"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595.276 841.89"

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(001.008S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.008S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times: Standard "(001.008S)" Standard ROM

*DefaultOutputOrder: Normal
*OpenUI *Duplex/2-Sided Printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off (1-Sided): "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long-Edge (Manual): "<</Duplex true>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short-Edge (Manual): "<</Duplex true /Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex
